        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The single most disorienting aspect of moving from PowerShell (or NuShell, or any object-pipeline shell) to Bash/Zsh/Fish is not the syntax — it is the pipeline model. Everything else follows from this."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#004",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
