        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nOBJECT PIPELINE vs TEXT STREAM — THE CORE MENTAL MODEL\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#005",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:scripting:00-overview, git-history:scripting:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:scripting:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "scripting",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "scripting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Object Pipeline (PowerShell, NuShell)\n─────────────────────────────────────\n  Get-Process | Where-Object { $_.CPU -gt 100 } | Select-Object Name, CPU\n       │                    │                           │\n   returns                 receives                 receives\n   [Process[]]          [Process]               [Process]\n   (.NET objects)       access .CPU              access .Name, .CPU\n                        (typed property)         (typed properties)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#006",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:scripting:00-overview, git-history:scripting:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:scripting:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "scripting",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "scripting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  Objects flow through pipes. Properties are typed.   │\n  │  No parsing. No delimiter assumptions. No ambiguity. │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:scripting:00-overview, git-history:scripting:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:scripting:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "scripting",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "scripting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Text Stream (Bash, Zsh, Fish, sh)\n──────────────────────────────────\n  ps aux | awk '$3 > 10 { print $1, $3 }' | sort -k2 -rn\n     │           │                               │\n  prints       receives text,               receives text,\n  lines of     splits on whitespace,        sorts as text\n  text         compares column 3            by column 2"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#008",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:scripting:00-overview, git-history:scripting:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:scripting:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "scripting",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "scripting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  Strings flow through pipes. Everything is text.     │\n  │  You parse structure out of strings at each stage.   │\n  │  Field position, delimiter, quoting — all manual.    │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#009",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:scripting:00-overview, git-history:scripting:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "scripting/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:scripting:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "scripting",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "scripting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scripting Languages - Taxonomy and Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The consequence:\n  - PS:   pipeline stages NEVER need to parse — they query properties\n  - Bash: pipeline stages ALWAYS need to parse — grep/awk/cut/sed are parsers\n  - PS:   structured data is first-class (objects, hashtables)\n  - Bash: structured data is emergent (you impose structure via tools)\n```"
    },
    {
